<title>MACEDONIA: NATIONAL BANK OF MACEDONIA FIX FOR TUESDAY.</title>
<headline>NATIONAL BANK OF MACEDONIA FIX FOR TUESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SKOPJE 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Macedonia (NBM) fix for Tuesday:</p>
<p>    DEM 100 - 2,661.7933	USD   1 -  40.7600</p>
<p>    CHF 100 - 3,244.1937	ATS 100 - 378.3739</p>
<p>The NBM calculates the denar's rate against the German mark on the basis of the information submitted by banks during the morning. Denar rates against other currencies are worked out from the Frankfurt fixing rates, issued around 1500 local time.</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-84561</p>
</text>
